OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,6,Fstarts chilly, then dry and warm with
OL,7,Fhazy sunshine. More changeable early
OL,8,Fnext week with a chance of welcome
OL,9,Frain or showers, possible thundery.
OL,10,FTurning warmer and increasingly humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
